WEBVTT

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:23.860
(narrator)
The world of Pokémon... a
spinning globe of wonderment!

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.900
Home to an infinite array
of creatures

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.460
too varied
to fully comprehend!

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:30.600
Hundreds, perhaps thousands,

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.140
meticulously fashioned by
the forces of nature

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:36.470
in all its glory,
as only nature can.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:39.410
And no matter what corner of
the world you find yourself,

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:42.980
rest assured you'll
find Pokémon there as well!

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:50.620
Soaring overhead,
skimming the clouds,

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:53.860
and riding the currents
undersea!

00:00:56.430 --> 00:01:00.130
Sharing
the mountains' majesty,

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:05.470
and animating our many
lush green forests!

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:08.070
Happily making their
home in fields of grass.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:11.240
Exeggcutor!

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:14.080
While even our sprawling
cities are teeming with them!

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:17.480
Electrode,
Electrode!

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.580
People and Pokémon
find common ground

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.450
sharing the goal of victory
in the Pokémon battle,

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:26.390
vying to become friends,
comrades and Pokémon masters!

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:28.590
Mag!

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:32.000
Mortar!

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.160
Magmortar!

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.300
Rhyperior!

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:43.070
Rhy!

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:47.040
Rhy!
Magmortar!

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:55.950
Which brings us
to a young trainer

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:57.550
who has dedicated his life

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.990
to the love of Pokémon
and battling.

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:07.200
Ash Ketchum of Pallet Town
with his partner Pikachu,

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.130
working side-by-side,
catching Pokémon

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:12.100
and perfecting
the art of the Battle!

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:16.070
Traveling with good friends and
training with boundless energy!

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:18.210
For every Pokémon
our Heroes meet,

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:21.580
a new adventure
waits around the corner!

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:24.210
And, right now, somewhere
in this world,

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:26.080
a new Pokémon is waiting,

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:29.290
poised to soon make itself
known to our heroes,

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:33.260
heralding the start of a
new, and fantastic adventure...

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:38.960
Combee!

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:40.160
Combee, Combee!

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:42.030
Combee!

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:44.330
Min?

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.100
(sneezes)

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.190
Min!

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:11.360
Min?

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:17.400
¶

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.490
(computer)
<i> Currently making</i>
<i> contact with Dialga.</i>

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.730
Min!

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:58.810
Min!

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:07.380
<i> Giratina</i>
<i> has captured Dialga</i>

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.120
<i> and is returning to</i>
<i> the Reverse World.</i>

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:10.490
(man)
They
won't make it.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.620
Find the next point
of appearance.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:15.190
<i> As you wish, Zero.</i>

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:17.490
Min!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.070
Min!

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.500
Sheldon!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:34.240
Has Giratina
captured Dialga?

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:39.350
What is this?

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:42.220
What's
it doing here?

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:50.130
Min!

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:09.150
Min!

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:12.520
Min!

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:15.790
Min!

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.420
Min!

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:39.440
Min!

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:42.810
Min?

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:46.720
Min!

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:59.300
Min!

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:02.930
Min!

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.600
Min!

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:09.870
(Zero)
What was that?

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:12.680
(computer)
<i> That was not the work</i>
<i> of Giratina.</i>

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:16.310
<i> It seems to be</i>
<i> because of that Pokémon.</i>

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.750
<i> Giratina approaches...</i>

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:07.960
¶

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:10.530
It's trapped!

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:13.270
Dialga must have
done something to it...

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.570
We've come too
late.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:53.540
(computer)
<i> It appears after coming</i>
<i> in contact with Dialga,</i>

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:56.550
<i> Giratina is unable to leave</i>
<i> the Reverse World.</i>

00:07:56.550 --> 00:08:00.850
<i> Time is now running in an</i>
<i> infinite loop around Giratina.</i>

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:03.420
What's this?

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:07.720
Min!

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:14.530
Min, Min!

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:17.400
Min!

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:39.820
¶

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:06.510
Pika!

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.880
(narrator)
Wonders never cease
for Ash and Pikachu,

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:11.050
as their Pokémon journey
continues!

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:13.480
With a little help from
his friends Dawn and Brock.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.820
Piplup!

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:16.690
And in a beautiful setting
such as this,

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:18.890
a bite to eat
will never taste better!

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:20.520
There!

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:22.490
Piping hot and
straight off the grill!
Wow!

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.660
Cool! Let's dig in!

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:25.900
Pika, Pika!

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:27.100
Hold on a minute.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.600
Did you wash
your hands?

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:32.030
Uh... Look, they're
clean as a whistle!

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:34.740
Pika.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:36.640
Ash Ketchum!

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:39.110
You should always remember to
wash your hands before you eat!

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.710
All right,
whatever...

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:41.980
Man what a pain...

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:43.910
Piplup! Piplup!

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.650
Piplup, Pip!
Pikachu!

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:47.180
I made more than
enough for everybody!

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:49.220
Pika!

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:50.690
Lup!
Tada!

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.820
My extra special
Pokémon food!

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:54.490
Piplup!
Pika!

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:57.860
All right! It's time to eat.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.830
Chi, Pachirisu!
Ambipom!

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.770
Bun, Bun, Bun, Bun!
Swinub, Nub!

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:06.570
Hey, I'm not gonna
leave you guys out.

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:10.710
Chimchar!

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:12.580
Char, Char, Char, Char!
Twig, Twig, Twig!

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:13.780
Bui, Bui!
Staravia!

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.010
Gliscor!

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:16.850
Wait'll you feast
your eyes on this feast!

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.550
Sudowoodo!

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:22.750
Happiny!
Sudowoodo!

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:24.750
Croag...

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:28.560
(Brock)
C'mon guys
quiet down a little!

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:30.030
(Dawn)
No shocking,
Pachirisu!

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:32.090
(Ash)
Gliscor, don't
push Chimchar!

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.500
Tasty, huh?

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.860
Calm down and eat...

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:36.200
Min?

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:45.140
I'm getting hungry
watching them chow down!

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:48.080
Me too!
So, let's eat!

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:52.580
Hey, stop!

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.180
Those're our pancakes
you know!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:56.120
What is it?
A Pokémon?

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.550
Pika?
Pip?

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:59.620
Pika, Pikachu!

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:01.520
Pip!

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.890
Piplup, Piplup,
Piplup!

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:04.090
Pip, Piplup!

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:05.760
Min, Min,
Min, Min, Min!

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.000
Pip?
Pi?

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:08.760
Piplup, Piplup!
Pika?

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.030
Pip, Piplup,
Pip, Pip, Piplup!

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:11.230
Min, Min,
Min, Min...

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:12.640
Pip!
Pika!

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.900
Piplup, Pip.

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:16.840
Uh-oh!

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.310
Min...

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:27.850
Min...

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:50.970
Pip!

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:52.880
Pika!
Piplup!

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:55.810
Piplup, Piplup,
Piplup, Piplup, Pip!

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:59.350
Min!

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.580
Min...

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:05.820
Stop it right now!

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:07.090
No need
to worry.

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:08.290
Don't be afraid...

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.290
Min!

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:18.230
¶

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.370
Gliscor!

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.310
Gliscor...

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:30.210
Min, Min,
Min, Min, Min...

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:36.190
Min?

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:38.920
There!

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.860
Nice and clean!

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:43.060
(Shaymin)
That did
feel nice...

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:46.000
I'll bet it did.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.630
Although it was a
little chilly.

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:52.400
And perhaps if you'd
been the tiniest bit gentler...

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:54.900
Pika!
Did you...?

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.170
Yeah,
I heard it!

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:59.170
It's telepathy!

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:01.880
Okay, so where
did you come from?

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:03.150
From over there.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.350
From over where?

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:06.280
I said
from over there.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.680
And I said what do you
mean by over there?

00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:10.150
Pika!

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:13.390
Well, if you head a little
further from over here

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:15.090
and then you
head over there...

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:18.090
Something's
not right!

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:19.290
It's got
a fever!

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:20.760
Pika!

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.670
We should go to
the Pokémon Center!

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:23.970
Yeah,
let's hurry!

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:25.200
'Kay gang return!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:27.070
Scor!

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.140
(Dawn)
Return!
Ambi!

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:31.370
(Brock) Return!
Sudowoodo!

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:32.940
You too!

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:34.280
Croagunk!

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:41.920
(Nurse Joy)
It's a Shaymin,
the Gratitude Pokémon.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:44.850
It does look awfully
tired...

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.420
Min.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:48.690
Chansey!

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:50.890
But everything's
just fine!

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:53.260
And this little
Shaymin's back to full health!

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:54.460
Shaymin...

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:56.230
That's what it is.
Pika.

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:59.230
Pip, Piplup!
The Gratitude Pokémon...

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:02.340
And my name's Brock,
the gratitude person!

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.770
I'm grateful to have met
you Nurse Joy!

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:06.040
Grateful!

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:08.110
Now, will you
go out with me?

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:09.480
So grateful!

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:12.050
Of course we could
always just be friends!

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.420
Still more grateful!

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:15.880
Of course,
perhaps...

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:18.890
Let's stick with
the friend line...

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:20.720
Croag...

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.430
Piplup.

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:30.370
Chansey, Chansey.

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:33.470
Pip?

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:35.470
Piplup, Pip,
Piplup!

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:36.870
Dear...

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.840
Where--
where am I?

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:40.980
At the
Pokémon Center!

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:43.850
Nurse Joy treated you, and
now you're all better!

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:45.050
Oh, please!

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:46.480
I never
need healing!

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:48.080
But I do get
hungry...

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:50.520
That sure doesn't sound
like gratitude to me...

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.120
Well, you
sound fine now!

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:53.820
I'm glad you're
feeling healthy.

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:55.090
My name is Dawn!

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:56.930
And my partner Piplup
is over here!

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:59.290
Pip!
Pika!

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:01.830
Pi!
I've got just the thing.

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.530
Try this, it's called
a poffin.

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:05.130
I made it myself.

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:07.170
Oh, thank you!

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:11.010
So?

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:12.270
It's okay,
I guess...

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:13.510
Okay?

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:15.180
Hey--
I'm Ash!

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.380
I want you to meet my
partner Pikachu!

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.210
Pikachu!

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:23.790
Pika!

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:29.020
Whoa, you're not
gonna blow up, are you?

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:30.830
It breathed in smoke
from our stove...

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:32.030
A-ha!

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:33.360
That would be
called Seed Flare.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:35.460
Wha--
Seed Flare?

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.330
When a Shaymin breathes
in polluted air,

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.100
it purifies
it in its body,

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.140
separating it into light and
water and then expelling it.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.840
That process is
called Seed Flare!

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:45.570
Pika!
Lup!

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:48.440
Shaymin, you're really
something aren't you?

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:50.080
I am
aren't I?

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:51.410
(Nurse Joy)
One thing...

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:54.180
There was a Shaymin
who used Seed Flare,

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:58.550
and when it inhaled toxic air it
destroyed an entire forest!

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:03.130
You're all lucky your stove
had very little toxicity.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:05.490
I would say you owe
me a big thank you!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.930
We're supposed
to tell you that!

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:09.930
And don't forget we're the
ones who brought you

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:11.200
to the
Pokémon Center!
Pika!

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.570
That was
your idea!
What?

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:15.540
But wait...

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:17.540
What in the world would a
Shaymin be doing here,

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:19.140
of all places?

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:21.180
I shouldn't
be here should I?
Piplup!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:22.380
So what happened?

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:24.580
I was tossed
all over the place!

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:26.280
It was horrible!

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:28.150
That's how you got
covered by all that dirt!

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.950
I know!

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:32.920
So you're going to bring me
to the Flower Garden right?

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.990
Look here, I have to
go to the Flower Garden

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:36.190
and that's that!

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:37.930
For the Flower
Bearing of course!

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:40.530
Flower Bearing?
Never heard of
that before...

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.160
(Nurse Joy)
Shaymin have
a custom.

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:44.330
Once every season a group
of them gather together

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:46.200
in a garden,
and migrate,

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:50.310
then a brand new garden grows
wherever they decide to stop.

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:53.280
That's where the name
Flower Bearing comes from.

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:55.980
I'm going to fly off from
the Flower Garden!

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:57.880
Wow--
You can fly?

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.410
Don't tell
me you can't...

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:00.620
Of course
I can't!

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:03.220
Aw, what a shame!
Man...

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:05.890
Come on--
Let's go to the Flower Garden!

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.220
So where
is it?

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:09.220
It's right
over there!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.960
Let's go now!

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:12.360
I thought you said
you could fly.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.000
I can but not now.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.230
What's that supposed
to mean?

00:18:15.230 --> 00:18:17.070
No need to worry!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:19.430
You'll get to the Flower Garden
'cause we'll all take you!

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:20.900
Piplup!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.100
Pika, Pika!

00:18:22.110 --> 00:18:23.410
(Brock)
Shall we
get moving?

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.970
(Ash)
Right--
Let's do it!

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:27.080
Gratitude Pokémon...!
Shaymin!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.310
Of course we're talking
primo rare!

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:31.680
Giving a gratitudinous gift
of Shaymin to the Boss

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:34.020
would certainly gift
back to us in spades!

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:36.220
Wealth beyond
our wildest dreams!

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:38.090
We'll be bursting
at the money seams!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:40.390
So, it's Operation
Swipe Shaymin!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:41.590
Yeah!
Right!

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:43.330
Wobbuff--

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:51.700
(Ash)
Okay which
way should we go?

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:54.000
That way! No, this way!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.200
No, this way!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:56.970
Make up your mind!

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:58.410
Now, Ash...

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:00.280
So, which way,
Shaymin?

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:13.290
Pika!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:14.490
It's like a bouquet!

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:16.060
It's that way!

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:18.130
Lup? Piplup!

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:22.060
Someone please tell
me which way that way is?

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:25.030
Pip, Pip, Pip,
Pip, Pip, Pip...

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:35.610
Min! Oh, no!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:37.350
Min!

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:39.550
They're here!
But who's here?

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:41.350
Them--
They are!

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:42.550
Min!

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:44.020
Pika!

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:46.020
We put the "they"
in them!

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:48.090
And of course you
put the "T" in twerps!

00:19:48.090 --> 00:19:49.660
(Meowth)
Kinda says it all
doesn't it?

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.460
Stop,
Team Rocket!

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:59.170
Shaymin!

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:02.100
(Team Rocket)
Slippery fingers!

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.310
What's that?

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:04.770
Pika!

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:12.080
Dawn!

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:14.420
But how?

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:20.090
Lup!

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:22.520
Pip, Piplup!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:26.090
What's going
on?

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:27.730
I feel like I
don't weigh anything!
Lup!

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:30.030
I don't like
this place...

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:32.730
Please get me out
of here now!

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:36.410
Piplup!

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:38.540
Pip,
Piplup, Piplup!

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:41.110
Was that
a Pokémon?

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:44.210
Pika!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:53.320
It's going
to eat me!

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:55.120
Pikachu, quick--
Thunderbolt!

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:58.090
Pikachu,
Pikachu!

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:00.560
Is it gone?

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:01.760
Lup, Piplup!

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:03.230
There it is!

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:05.270
Piplup--
Use Bubblebeam!

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:06.470
Piplup!

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:08.270
Pip, Pip, Pip!

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:17.710
Stop it,
all of you!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:19.580
You can't
upset Giratina!

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:22.120
Giratina?
That's what that is?

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:23.750
Shieldon!

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.390
Over here!
Right...!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:32.690
Piplup!
Pika!

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:35.560
Lup!

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:36.770
Pika, Pika!

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:38.500
Shieldon!

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:46.410
Piplup!
Shieldon!

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:48.510
Piplup, Piplup!

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:57.490
Be careful!

00:21:57.490 --> 00:21:59.190
My body feels
normal again!

00:21:59.190 --> 00:22:02.260
We made it through
the low-gravity zone!

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:04.390
This is some weird
place, for sure...

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:06.830
Piplup, Pip, Piplup!

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:08.530
Pika!

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:10.370
Pika, Pika!

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:11.570
Pi!

00:22:11.570 --> 00:22:13.400
Pika...

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:22.480
Is anybody hurt?

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:24.810
Well, I managed
not to get eaten!

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:26.780
Are you the Shaymin
from before?

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:29.180
Are you--
Who are you?

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:30.920
Newton Graceland
is the name!

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:33.420
I'm in the process of
researching the Reverse World.

00:22:33.420 --> 00:22:36.220
And just so you know, among
those in my field

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:39.390
I'm considered a
genius if I do say so myself.

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:41.760
Why doesn't he tell us
what he really thinks?

00:22:41.770 --> 00:22:43.500
Humble guy.
Pika.

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:44.700
What a weirdo!

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:46.540
Come on!

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:50.210
That's no way to treat
someone who saved your lives.

00:22:50.210 --> 00:22:53.180
(Dawn)
I'm sorry.
Thank you for saving us!

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:54.440
My name's Ash!

00:22:54.440 --> 00:22:55.640
And I'm Dawn!

00:22:55.650 --> 00:22:57.210
Pikachu!
Piplup!

00:22:57.210 --> 00:22:59.610
Uh, what exactly
is the Reverse World?

00:22:59.620 --> 00:23:00.820
And what's
a Giratina?

00:23:00.820 --> 00:23:03.190
Ahh, excellent
questions, those.

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:04.690
Allow me to
explain!

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:07.360
We're now in the middle
of an alternate world

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:09.290
the location of which
is exactly opposite

00:23:09.290 --> 00:23:10.660
the world of reality!

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:13.360
World of reality?
Pika?

00:23:13.360 --> 00:23:15.860
The force of gravity
gets weaker and stronger here

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:18.200
depending on where
you happen to be,

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:21.670
which means here, we
have a distorted world!

00:23:26.310 --> 00:23:28.680
(Newton)
Even though
these two worlds

00:23:28.680 --> 00:23:30.610
exist side by side
with each other,

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:32.680
they do not
intersect at all.

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:35.520
However, Giratina,
and only Giratina,

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:38.420
has the power to travel
between these two worlds.

00:23:38.420 --> 00:23:40.660
Moreover, Giratina's
the only Pokémon

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:42.690
that exists
in this world,

00:23:42.690 --> 00:23:45.290
which is to say Giratina's the
master of the Reverse World,

00:23:45.300 --> 00:23:46.490
as it were.

00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:48.460
Well, I don't
like Giratina.

00:23:48.470 --> 00:23:50.430
That monster tried
to eat me!

00:23:50.430 --> 00:23:51.630
Huh...

00:23:51.640 --> 00:23:53.840
Why would that be?

00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:56.870
Would you all perhaps like to
go back to the real world?

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:58.670
You bet!
Pika!

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:01.580
I have to get to the
Flower Garden right away!

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:04.580
Then in that case there's
not a moment to lose.

00:24:04.580 --> 00:24:06.250
Pika?
What does
that mean?

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:07.950
All right,
there's still time.

00:24:07.950 --> 00:24:09.880
Come on, be lively!

00:24:09.890 --> 00:24:11.890
Pip?

00:24:11.890 --> 00:24:13.290
Piplup!

00:24:15.530 --> 00:24:17.990
This place looks
like a circus funhouse.

00:24:18.000 --> 00:24:20.660
But we're not having fun
and we're all alone.

00:24:20.660 --> 00:24:23.470
Hey, I've heard of not having
any idea which end's up,

00:24:23.470 --> 00:24:24.670
but this?

00:24:24.670 --> 00:24:26.670
This is ridiculous,
even for us!

00:24:26.670 --> 00:24:28.940
(Team Rocket)
That's saying something.

00:24:42.050 --> 00:24:45.620
Whoa, man!

00:24:45.620 --> 00:24:47.820
(Newton)
I became obsessed
with the Reverse World

00:24:47.820 --> 00:24:50.430
and started researching
it exhaustively.

00:24:50.430 --> 00:24:54.060
The next thing I knew
five years had gone by.

00:24:54.060 --> 00:24:55.630
Funny guy...

00:24:55.630 --> 00:24:57.470
Well he
seems impressive!

00:24:57.470 --> 00:24:59.400
(Shaymin)
He's a weirdo!

00:25:01.340 --> 00:25:03.610
(Dawn)
What's that?

00:25:03.610 --> 00:25:06.310
(Newton)
When there are imbalances
in the real world,

00:25:06.310 --> 00:25:09.080
this world then corrects
them to maintain the balance

00:25:09.080 --> 00:25:10.680
between time
and space.

00:25:10.680 --> 00:25:13.650
Whenever this occurs
a black cloud appears!

00:25:13.650 --> 00:25:15.050
Lup!

00:25:15.050 --> 00:25:16.480
Pip, Piplup!
Pika?

00:25:18.890 --> 00:25:21.460
Pip? Piplup!
Pika!

00:25:21.460 --> 00:25:22.660
Don't breathe
it in!

00:25:22.660 --> 00:25:24.760
Piplup!

00:25:24.760 --> 00:25:27.530
Pi, Pi, Pi,
Pi, Pi, Pi, Pi!

00:25:27.530 --> 00:25:28.760
It's poisonous!

00:25:28.770 --> 00:25:31.630
One quick breath and
you're done for.

00:25:31.640 --> 00:25:33.500
Shieldon, Shield!

00:25:33.500 --> 00:25:36.400
Piplup!

00:25:36.410 --> 00:25:38.470
Pikachu!

00:25:45.020 --> 00:25:47.520
You see, once
time and space,

00:25:47.520 --> 00:25:50.620
two dimensions that never
should've met, collided

00:25:50.620 --> 00:25:53.490
and unraveled
each other!

00:25:53.490 --> 00:25:56.790
¶

00:26:03.770 --> 00:26:06.940
Dialga and Palkia both
thought that their territories

00:26:06.940 --> 00:26:08.500
had been violated,

00:26:08.510 --> 00:26:10.540
so they began
fighting fiercely.

00:26:10.540 --> 00:26:12.110
Whoa... Remember that?

00:26:12.110 --> 00:26:13.840
Back in Alamos Town!

00:26:13.840 --> 00:26:16.780
As a result, both time and
space were bent violently,

00:26:16.780 --> 00:26:18.650
and the sum total
of the Reverse World

00:26:18.650 --> 00:26:22.050
started overflowing with
all of this toxicity.

00:26:23.650 --> 00:26:27.390
¶

00:26:44.510 --> 00:26:48.040
Giratina was absolutely
furious with Dialga and Palkia

00:26:48.040 --> 00:26:49.680
for defiling its home,

00:26:49.680 --> 00:26:51.710
so it made its way
to the real world

00:26:51.720 --> 00:26:54.520
and proceeded
to capture Dialga!

00:26:54.520 --> 00:26:56.480
Dialga?

00:26:56.490 --> 00:26:57.750
However...

00:26:57.750 --> 00:27:00.090
Min, Min!

00:27:01.860 --> 00:27:03.090
Shield!

00:27:03.090 --> 00:27:05.460
Min!

00:27:07.600 --> 00:27:13.030
(Newton)
Thanks to Shaymin's Seed Flare,
Dialga managed to escape!

00:27:13.040 --> 00:27:15.470
That's why
Giratina's angry.

00:27:15.470 --> 00:27:16.810
Right, angry
with Shaymin!

00:27:16.810 --> 00:27:19.740
Really, really angry!

00:27:26.750 --> 00:27:29.120
(Newton)
But that's
not all.

00:27:29.120 --> 00:27:31.750
Giratina can no longer
go into the real world

00:27:31.760 --> 00:27:33.690
because of Dialga!

00:27:33.690 --> 00:27:35.660
Serves Giratina
right!

00:27:35.660 --> 00:27:37.590
Pika...
Let the punishment
fit the crime!

00:27:37.590 --> 00:27:40.130
Pika?
Look, it's Brock!

00:27:40.130 --> 00:27:42.160
You're right!
He's still back there!

00:27:45.500 --> 00:27:46.770
Come on.

00:27:46.770 --> 00:27:49.040
You guys...
where are you?

00:27:49.040 --> 00:27:50.470
Hey, Brock!

00:27:50.470 --> 00:27:52.110
Can you
hear us?

00:27:52.110 --> 00:27:54.110
Stop it!
Pika!

00:27:56.850 --> 00:27:59.180
If something gets
destroyed here,

00:27:59.180 --> 00:28:02.180
it has a big influence
on the real world.

00:28:02.190 --> 00:28:07.490
Any changes to those bubbles
are reflected in the real world.

00:28:07.490 --> 00:28:11.730
Now gravity gets strange
again starting right here.

00:28:13.260 --> 00:28:15.160
But it can
be kind of fun!
Shieldon!

00:28:15.170 --> 00:28:18.170
There-- Our destination's
straight ahead!

00:28:20.640 --> 00:28:23.940
¶

00:28:25.010 --> 00:28:26.210
Look out!

00:28:26.210 --> 00:28:28.140
Let's run!

00:28:28.140 --> 00:28:30.010
Min!

00:28:30.010 --> 00:28:32.080
Min, Min!

00:28:42.730 --> 00:28:45.030
Oh, no!

00:28:46.800 --> 00:28:48.030
No, Shaymin!

00:28:48.030 --> 00:28:49.800
Piplup!
What do we do?

00:28:49.800 --> 00:28:51.070
Pika?

00:28:51.070 --> 00:28:52.630
Pika!

00:28:55.040 --> 00:28:57.910
You people need
to get on the ball!
Pikachu!

00:28:57.910 --> 00:28:59.170
Piplup, Piplup!

00:28:59.180 --> 00:29:01.110
But...

00:29:08.820 --> 00:29:10.720
Substitute!

00:29:10.720 --> 00:29:13.960
I've got to say,
I'm thoroughly impressed!

00:29:13.960 --> 00:29:17.030
Sorry but flattery will
get you nowhere.

00:29:20.330 --> 00:29:22.300
Whatever! We've got to go!

00:29:22.300 --> 00:29:24.100
Hurry!

00:29:26.270 --> 00:29:29.840
Shieldon!
It's over there!

00:29:29.840 --> 00:29:32.140
You can't come in there but
you should be able to get out!

00:29:32.140 --> 00:29:33.580
Jump quickly!
Lup?

00:29:33.580 --> 00:29:37.010
Piplup!

00:29:39.020 --> 00:29:41.350
Piplup! Piplup!

00:29:41.350 --> 00:29:42.780
Piplup!

00:29:42.790 --> 00:29:45.150
Pikachu!
Pikachu!

00:29:48.020 --> 00:29:49.760
Dawn!

00:29:52.960 --> 00:29:54.260
But what
about you?

00:29:54.260 --> 00:29:57.200
I've still got some things
to tend to here.

00:29:57.200 --> 00:29:59.070
Now hurry or you
won't be able to get out!

00:29:59.070 --> 00:30:00.800
Right.

00:30:05.010 --> 00:30:07.240
Giratina can see
into the real world,

00:30:07.240 --> 00:30:10.650
so watch your step and also
beware of mirrors!

00:30:16.750 --> 00:30:18.050
You made it!

00:30:18.050 --> 00:30:19.250
Piplup!
I think so...!

00:30:19.260 --> 00:30:21.020
Pika, Pi!

00:30:23.330 --> 00:30:25.290
(Jesse)
Wait!

00:30:25.300 --> 00:30:28.130
We want
go home too!

00:30:28.130 --> 00:30:31.900
Yeah, leave this weightless
stuff for the astronauts!

00:30:47.980 --> 00:30:49.950
(computer)
<i> Giratina</i>
<i> is surfacing.</i>

00:30:49.950 --> 00:30:51.750
(Zero)
Is Dialga nearby?

00:30:51.760 --> 00:30:54.020
<i> No, it's outside</i>
<i> of the radar's field.</i>

00:30:59.000 --> 00:31:02.960
Infi, zoom in on the spot where
Giratina tried to surface...

00:31:02.970 --> 00:31:04.300
<i> Right!</i>

00:31:07.340 --> 00:31:09.200
(Brock)
Where'd
you all go?

00:31:09.210 --> 00:31:11.110
(Ash)
To the Reverse World!

00:31:11.110 --> 00:31:13.070
What's that?
Where's Newton?

00:31:13.080 --> 00:31:15.280
He stayed back there.
Pika?

00:31:15.280 --> 00:31:17.150
He said
"beware of mirrors"...

00:31:17.150 --> 00:31:19.250
The mirror?

00:31:19.250 --> 00:31:22.880
It's coming
this way!

00:31:22.890 --> 00:31:25.320
This place is dangerous.
Let's go!

00:31:25.320 --> 00:31:27.190
(Brock)
Tell me
what's going on!

00:31:32.000 --> 00:31:33.390
I see...

00:31:33.400 --> 00:31:35.830
So that's
how it is.

00:31:35.830 --> 00:31:37.070
(Infi)
<i> Be careful.</i>

00:31:37.070 --> 00:31:39.230
<i> I await your return.</i>

00:31:42.340 --> 00:31:43.910
(Brock)
A Giratina?

00:31:43.910 --> 00:31:45.810
In the Reverse World?

00:31:45.810 --> 00:31:47.380
I wish I could have
seen that...

00:31:47.380 --> 00:31:49.780
(Dawn)
Then you would've
seen how dangerous it was!

00:31:49.780 --> 00:31:52.350
Thanks to me you're
all safe and sound!

00:31:52.350 --> 00:31:54.350
Aren't you
grateful I'm around?

00:31:54.350 --> 00:31:56.350
Don't forget it was you
that got us in this mess

00:31:56.350 --> 00:31:57.950
in the first place!

00:31:57.950 --> 00:31:59.790
It's time to step
up to the plate!

00:31:59.790 --> 00:32:02.420
It's time for you to get
me to the Flower Garden!

00:32:02.430 --> 00:32:04.290
'Stead of yappin'
about the Flower Garden,

00:32:04.290 --> 00:32:05.890
tell me where
it is!

00:32:05.900 --> 00:32:07.230
It's over there!

00:32:07.230 --> 00:32:08.830
No, wait,
it's over here!

00:32:08.830 --> 00:32:10.430
Magnemite! Magnemite!

00:32:10.430 --> 00:32:11.830
Piplup?
Pika?

00:32:11.840 --> 00:32:13.430
Piplup?
Magnemite!

00:32:13.440 --> 00:32:15.400
Magnemite!
Magnemite!

00:32:15.410 --> 00:32:17.210
Man now
what's going on?

00:32:17.210 --> 00:32:19.910
Pika!

00:32:19.910 --> 00:32:22.310
Magneton!

00:32:22.310 --> 00:32:24.880
Magnemite!
Magnemite!

00:32:24.880 --> 00:32:27.320
I'll just take that
Shaymin off your hands.

00:32:27.320 --> 00:32:28.820
You're popular...

00:32:28.820 --> 00:32:31.420
He must want to
eat me too!

00:32:31.420 --> 00:32:33.290
I don't think
that's what he wants...

00:32:33.290 --> 00:32:34.890
Okay, who are you?

00:32:34.890 --> 00:32:36.190
And how do you know
our Shaymin?

00:32:36.190 --> 00:32:37.760
(Shaymin)
I don't know him!

00:32:37.760 --> 00:32:39.160
(Brock)
Well, he's not
a trainer.

00:32:39.160 --> 00:32:41.130
Magnezone,
Mirror Shot, now!

00:32:41.130 --> 00:32:43.030
Magnezone!

00:32:43.030 --> 00:32:45.130
Pikachu,
Use Thunder Bolt!

00:32:45.140 --> 00:32:47.940
Pikachu!
Magnezone!

00:32:51.510 --> 00:32:53.410
Let's go!

00:32:57.780 --> 00:32:59.010
Lup, Pip,
Piplup!

00:32:59.020 --> 00:33:00.550
Piplup,
Whirlpool!

00:33:00.550 --> 00:33:02.220
Pip, Piplup!

00:33:02.220 --> 00:33:05.090
Piplup!

00:33:14.230 --> 00:33:16.000
Magnezone!

00:33:23.310 --> 00:33:24.840
Piplup!

00:33:24.840 --> 00:33:27.310
Can't you smooth
out this bumpy ride?

00:33:27.310 --> 00:33:28.810
What do you think?

00:33:28.810 --> 00:33:31.350
Lup, Pip,
Lup, Piplup!

00:33:31.350 --> 00:33:35.180
Magnemite, Magnemite!

00:33:35.190 --> 00:33:36.580
Magnezone!

00:33:36.590 --> 00:33:38.920
Magnemite, Magnemite!

00:33:38.920 --> 00:33:41.460
Magnemite!
Magnemite!
Magnemite!

00:33:46.160 --> 00:33:49.530
¶

00:33:53.300 --> 00:33:55.300
Magnezone!

00:34:06.480 --> 00:34:08.950
There were, like,
a million of 'em...!

00:34:08.950 --> 00:34:11.050
I'm hungry!

00:34:12.860 --> 00:34:14.090
Stop it!

00:34:14.090 --> 00:34:15.620
I loved whatever
we had this morning.

00:34:15.630 --> 00:34:17.360
You mean
pancakes?

00:34:17.360 --> 00:34:18.930
We're out
of those.

00:34:18.930 --> 00:34:21.160
It's okay! I still have some
Poffins.

00:34:21.160 --> 00:34:23.060
Here!

00:34:26.500 --> 00:34:28.540
Dawn you're
wonderful!

00:34:28.540 --> 00:34:30.100
Way nicer
than Ash...

00:34:30.110 --> 00:34:31.910
Oh, yeah?

00:34:35.080 --> 00:34:36.380
Why you little...

00:34:36.380 --> 00:34:37.880
I'm scared!

00:34:37.880 --> 00:34:39.350
Now you
just stop that!

00:34:39.350 --> 00:34:40.880
You saw
that burp!

00:34:40.880 --> 00:34:42.380
Shaymin didn't
mean to.

00:34:42.390 --> 00:34:44.120
Right?
Certainly not.

00:34:44.120 --> 00:34:45.420
Told you.

00:34:45.420 --> 00:34:46.650
So, let's
go then.

00:34:46.660 --> 00:34:48.490
Chop chop!
Piplup!

00:34:48.490 --> 00:34:50.260
Man...

00:34:50.260 --> 00:34:52.490
I'm glad we made it onto
this train and everything

00:34:52.500 --> 00:34:53.960
but where are
we going?

00:34:53.960 --> 00:34:55.330
Good question...

00:34:55.330 --> 00:34:57.060
Pi?

00:35:07.180 --> 00:35:10.210
(man)
I used to hike in the
mountains when I was a kid.

00:35:10.210 --> 00:35:12.410
And one time,
I actually got to see

00:35:12.420 --> 00:35:13.980
the Shaymin's Flower
Bearing!

00:35:13.980 --> 00:35:16.220
Wow!
Yeah, what a lucky guy!

00:35:16.220 --> 00:35:19.350
Hey, I'll bet that's why
you've got such a cute wife!

00:35:21.190 --> 00:35:22.660
It's so cute!

00:35:22.660 --> 00:35:25.230
It's gonna bite!

00:35:25.230 --> 00:35:27.560
It's all right.
I don't bite.

00:35:27.560 --> 00:35:30.430
Hey!

00:35:30.430 --> 00:35:31.970
May I
hold it?

00:35:31.970 --> 00:35:34.970
Of course!

00:35:34.970 --> 00:35:37.940
There, there...

00:35:50.590 --> 00:35:53.490
Giratina's
moving again!

00:35:53.490 --> 00:35:55.690
Professor!
Don't leave us
in the lurch!

00:35:55.690 --> 00:36:00.190
Then come with me if
you want to learn something!

00:36:00.200 --> 00:36:02.660
If you can't beat
'em, join 'em.

00:36:07.570 --> 00:36:09.570
Amazing.
They're like twins!

00:36:09.570 --> 00:36:11.610
Yeah!
What're those?

00:36:11.610 --> 00:36:13.540
Gracidea flowers,
Dawn!

00:36:13.540 --> 00:36:16.110
Gracidea flowers?

00:36:18.310 --> 00:36:20.610
Around these parts if you
really want to show someone

00:36:20.620 --> 00:36:23.520
your gratitude you send them a
bouquet of Gracidea Flowers,

00:36:23.520 --> 00:36:26.290
since they look like
Shaymin the Gratitude Pokémon!

00:36:26.290 --> 00:36:29.060
But it's wonderful that I'm
getting to hold the real thing!

00:36:29.060 --> 00:36:31.530
You're grateful,
right?
Yeah!

00:36:31.530 --> 00:36:33.530
You'd better be
careful with that one!

00:36:33.530 --> 00:36:35.560
It might blow up
at any moment!

00:36:35.570 --> 00:36:39.200
I don't do
that to nice people!

00:36:39.200 --> 00:36:42.200
Layla and all her friends are
going back to their hometown.

00:36:42.210 --> 00:36:44.740
It's my great-grandmother's
hundredth birthday!

00:36:44.740 --> 00:36:47.480
She took such good care of
me when I was a little girl,

00:36:47.480 --> 00:36:50.480
so I figured I would give her a
bouquet of Gracidea Flowers

00:36:50.480 --> 00:36:52.450
to show my
gratitude!

00:36:55.550 --> 00:36:57.590
Min?

00:36:58.620 --> 00:37:00.350
Min?

00:37:08.100 --> 00:37:10.160
Piplup!

00:37:15.770 --> 00:37:17.770
Pika!

00:37:23.310 --> 00:37:24.510
Pika?

00:37:24.510 --> 00:37:26.080
Shaymin!

00:37:29.450 --> 00:37:31.350
Pika!

00:37:36.360 --> 00:37:39.260
It's flying!
Piplup!

00:37:44.670 --> 00:37:46.130
What happened?

00:37:46.140 --> 00:37:48.440
See, Shaymin
changes into Sky Form

00:37:48.440 --> 00:37:51.110
when it comes in contact
with Gracidea pollen!

00:37:51.110 --> 00:37:53.070
Is that part of
the Flower Bearing?

00:37:53.080 --> 00:37:55.540
Right-- The Shaymin
gather at a Gracidea Garden

00:37:55.550 --> 00:37:58.480
where they change into
Sky Form and fly off!

00:37:58.480 --> 00:38:00.150
Pika!

00:38:00.150 --> 00:38:01.750
Do you know where
the Gracidea Garden is?

00:38:01.750 --> 00:38:03.720
We're lookin'
for it!

00:38:03.720 --> 00:38:05.520
Excuse me,
coming through!

00:38:05.520 --> 00:38:07.220
Follow me!

00:38:08.760 --> 00:38:10.420
Okay, check
out this map.

00:38:10.430 --> 00:38:12.460
Here's where we
are right now!

00:38:12.460 --> 00:38:14.730
If you transfer to a boat
at the next station,

00:38:14.730 --> 00:38:17.600
the Gracidea Garden
will be around here.

00:38:17.600 --> 00:38:21.570
You picked a good time 'cause
the flowers are ready to bloom.

00:38:21.570 --> 00:38:23.170
You see?

00:38:23.170 --> 00:38:24.640
I have to
go right away!

00:38:24.640 --> 00:38:26.570
My friends are
all there!

00:38:26.580 --> 00:38:28.540
If I do not make it
before the flowers bloom,

00:38:28.540 --> 00:38:30.440
I'll be left behind.

00:38:30.450 --> 00:38:31.810
That's why you were
in a rush!

00:38:31.810 --> 00:38:33.850
Exactly!

00:38:35.890 --> 00:38:39.450
Giratina was a problem,
but I'm fine now.

00:38:39.460 --> 00:38:41.860
I can fly there
anytime I want!

00:38:41.860 --> 00:38:44.260
I wanna see
the Flower Bearing too!

00:38:44.260 --> 00:38:45.830
Piplup!
Yeah, me too!

00:38:45.830 --> 00:38:47.830
Can't wait to see it!
Pika!

00:38:47.830 --> 00:38:49.760
It's something
to see.

00:38:49.770 --> 00:38:52.500
I love when
things turn out right!

00:38:52.500 --> 00:38:53.800
Pika?

00:38:53.800 --> 00:38:56.640
Magnezone!

00:39:08.280 --> 00:39:09.750
What do
they want?

00:39:09.750 --> 00:39:12.190
They're all trying to
capture Shaymin!

00:39:12.190 --> 00:39:15.320
No chance you're
ever going to get me!

00:39:15.320 --> 00:39:17.220
Magnemite, Magnemite!

00:39:18.690 --> 00:39:21.700
Shaymin!

00:39:23.600 --> 00:39:26.300
Told ya!

00:39:26.300 --> 00:39:28.170
Now Pikachu
Iron Tail!

00:39:28.170 --> 00:39:30.240
Ka! Pi, Pi, Pi!

00:39:30.240 --> 00:39:33.810
Pi, Chu, Pika!

00:39:33.810 --> 00:39:35.510
Pika!

00:39:35.510 --> 00:39:36.880
Wow,
well done!

00:39:36.880 --> 00:39:39.280
Pikachu, Pika! Pi!

00:39:39.280 --> 00:39:41.180
Quick,
Piplup, Bubblebeam!

00:39:41.180 --> 00:39:42.880
Piplup, Lup, Lup!

00:39:46.290 --> 00:39:48.520
Pika, Pika,
Pika, Pika, Pika!

00:39:48.520 --> 00:39:50.260
Pika, Pika!
Magnemite.

00:39:50.260 --> 00:39:51.930
Piplup!

00:39:51.930 --> 00:39:54.500
Pip,
Piplup, Piplup!

00:39:54.500 --> 00:39:56.230
Magnemite!

00:39:56.230 --> 00:39:58.470
Magnemite,
Magnemite!

00:39:58.470 --> 00:39:59.900
Magnemite!

00:39:59.900 --> 00:40:02.240
Pika, Pi!

00:40:02.240 --> 00:40:04.410
Pika, Pika!

00:40:04.410 --> 00:40:06.570
Pika...

00:40:06.580 --> 00:40:08.380
Chu!

00:40:11.450 --> 00:40:13.310
Magnemite,
Magnemite!

00:40:13.320 --> 00:40:14.950
Pika!
Piplup, Piplup!

00:40:19.260 --> 00:40:21.820
We did it!
All right!

00:40:21.820 --> 00:40:26.390
Magnezone!

00:40:26.400 --> 00:40:28.400
Pikachu, Thunderbolt,
let's go!

00:40:28.400 --> 00:40:29.660
Now, Piplup,
Bubblebeam!

00:40:29.670 --> 00:40:33.630
Pika, Pikachu!
Lup, Lup, Lup, Lup!

00:40:33.640 --> 00:40:35.570
Magnezone!

00:40:35.570 --> 00:40:37.440
Shaymin!

00:40:37.440 --> 00:40:39.010
Magnezone...

00:40:43.480 --> 00:40:45.780
Magnemite!

00:40:48.480 --> 00:40:49.720
Pikachu!

00:40:49.720 --> 00:40:52.620
Yes!
Pikachu!

00:40:54.990 --> 00:40:56.860
Every last one
of them!

00:40:56.860 --> 00:40:59.760
Have you changed a
little or is it just me?

00:40:59.760 --> 00:41:02.300
It's thank
Shaymin time!

00:41:02.300 --> 00:41:05.270
It's just
you, Brock!
Pikachu.

00:41:05.270 --> 00:41:07.000
Gull!

00:41:07.000 --> 00:41:09.700
Wingull!

00:41:09.710 --> 00:41:11.410
Gull!

00:41:11.410 --> 00:41:13.640
Piplup, Piplup!
Thanks for everything
everybody!

00:41:13.640 --> 00:41:15.380
Pika, Pika!

00:41:15.380 --> 00:41:16.910
Have a safe trip!

00:41:16.910 --> 00:41:20.350
And make sure you don't get
off in the wrong place!

00:41:20.350 --> 00:41:21.750
(Dawn)
No need to worry!

00:41:21.750 --> 00:41:22.950
(Ash)
We'll be fine!

00:41:22.950 --> 00:41:24.750
(man)
Be careful!

00:41:32.760 --> 00:41:35.760
(Infi)
<i> Welcome back,</i>
<i> Sir.</i>

00:41:35.770 --> 00:41:37.800
How's Giratina?

00:41:37.800 --> 00:41:40.370
<i> Giratina's</i>
<i> surfaced just once.</i>

00:41:40.370 --> 00:41:43.440
I knew it.

00:41:43.440 --> 00:41:47.540
Calculate where
Giratina will surface next.

00:41:47.540 --> 00:41:49.910
<i> Already in process.</i>

00:41:56.550 --> 00:41:59.320
(Dawn)
Brock, isn't
this part of the sea?

00:41:59.320 --> 00:42:02.090
(Brock)
The fact is, a glacier wore
away the mountain here

00:42:02.090 --> 00:42:04.590
and created this
valley a long time ago...

00:42:04.590 --> 00:42:06.030
(Ash)
A glacier?

00:42:06.030 --> 00:42:07.860
Like this!

00:42:07.860 --> 00:42:10.330
Ice has been covering and
wearing away at this mountain

00:42:10.330 --> 00:42:12.000
for tens of thousands
of years!
Pika!

00:42:12.000 --> 00:42:14.840
Whoa! Looks cold!

00:42:14.840 --> 00:42:17.100
And there's a glacier located
deep in the Flower Garden

00:42:17.110 --> 00:42:18.510
we're
headed to as well.

00:42:18.510 --> 00:42:19.910
Wow...
Pika!

00:42:19.910 --> 00:42:21.680
Pika!

00:42:21.680 --> 00:42:23.010
Piplup, Pip?

00:42:25.720 --> 00:42:26.950
Spheal, Spheal...

00:42:26.950 --> 00:42:28.580
Sealeo.

00:42:28.580 --> 00:42:30.120
Sealeo, Sealeo!

00:42:31.820 --> 00:42:34.820
¶

00:42:46.670 --> 00:42:49.700
Pika!

00:42:49.710 --> 00:42:51.370
Pika?

00:43:01.480 --> 00:43:03.450
Yeah!

00:43:11.390 --> 00:43:13.390
Whee!

00:43:17.570 --> 00:43:20.130
Pikachu!

00:43:20.140 --> 00:43:21.540
Pip!

00:43:21.540 --> 00:43:23.700
Piplup!

00:43:23.710 --> 00:43:27.070
Piplup, Piplup!
Pika!

00:43:28.610 --> 00:43:31.810
Piplup!

00:43:31.810 --> 00:43:33.680
Piplup, Pip,
Piplup!

00:43:33.680 --> 00:43:35.550
Pip, Piplup!

00:43:35.550 --> 00:43:36.980
Piplup!

00:43:36.990 --> 00:43:40.150
Piplup!

00:43:40.160 --> 00:43:46.890
Piplup!

00:43:46.900 --> 00:43:48.630
Piplup!

00:43:51.900 --> 00:43:53.830
Pika, Pika!

00:43:53.840 --> 00:43:56.070
Pikachu, you
flying with 'em?

00:43:56.070 --> 00:43:58.540
Pika!

00:43:58.540 --> 00:44:02.210
Staravia!
Pikachu!

00:44:02.210 --> 00:44:04.080
Pika!

00:44:08.180 --> 00:44:10.150
Staravia!

00:44:10.150 --> 00:44:11.890
Star!

00:44:16.030 --> 00:44:17.490
Staravia!

00:44:17.490 --> 00:44:19.790
Pika!

00:44:21.460 --> 00:44:23.760
Min!

00:44:25.600 --> 00:44:28.100
Pika, Pika!

00:44:28.100 --> 00:44:29.870
Piplup!
Pika!

00:44:29.870 --> 00:44:32.010
Piplup!

00:44:45.050 --> 00:44:46.550
Pika!

00:44:50.630 --> 00:44:53.130
Oh, no! You're coming as well!

00:44:53.130 --> 00:44:55.760
Pity... Much too heavy.

00:44:55.760 --> 00:44:57.530
Ouch!

00:44:57.530 --> 00:44:59.500
Pika?
Staravia!

00:44:59.500 --> 00:45:01.900
Pika!

00:45:01.900 --> 00:45:04.200
Altaria!
Star!

00:45:04.210 --> 00:45:07.110
Altaria!
Altaria, Altaria!

00:45:07.110 --> 00:45:10.110
Pika!

00:45:10.110 --> 00:45:12.080
Yeah!

00:45:14.220 --> 00:45:16.180
Shaymin's sure
having fun!

00:45:16.190 --> 00:45:18.250
Just like it'll be
at the Flower Garden!

00:45:18.250 --> 00:45:22.820
Flying off with all
its friends.

00:45:22.830 --> 00:45:26.790
Guess we won't have
much more time together.

00:45:26.800 --> 00:45:29.130
Shaymin...

00:45:33.300 --> 00:45:34.740
Know what?

00:45:34.740 --> 00:45:36.770
It's kind of
a relief.

00:45:36.770 --> 00:45:38.170
Hey!

00:45:38.170 --> 00:45:39.870
Ow, ow!

00:45:49.690 --> 00:45:51.950
<i> As you can see, we've</i>
<i> finally succeeded</i>

00:45:51.950 --> 00:45:53.950
<i> in entering</i>
<i> the Reverse World!</i>

00:45:53.960 --> 00:45:55.720
(man)
<i>Watch out!</i>

00:45:57.890 --> 00:45:59.960
<i>Master!</i>

00:45:59.960 --> 00:46:03.130
<i> Only Giratina can move freely</i>
<i> in and out of this world!</i>

00:46:03.130 --> 00:46:05.730
<i>Then let's grab</i>
<i> that power ourselves!</i>

00:46:05.730 --> 00:46:07.130
Right!

00:46:11.240 --> 00:46:14.210
Soon, it will
all be mine...

00:46:16.110 --> 00:46:18.250
(Infi)
<i> Giratina has surfaced.</i>

00:46:30.060 --> 00:46:32.790
Pip, Pip, Pip, Pip,
Pip, Piplup.

00:46:33.800 --> 00:46:35.630
What's that?

00:46:35.630 --> 00:46:38.030
That's the same thing
we got sucked into before!

00:46:38.030 --> 00:46:40.070
Uh-oh!

00:46:40.070 --> 00:46:41.300
Let's get out
of here!

00:46:41.300 --> 00:46:43.600
I'm not
going anywhere!

00:46:46.040 --> 00:46:48.380
Pika, Pika!

00:46:49.650 --> 00:46:52.680
Piplup!

00:46:52.680 --> 00:46:54.950
Pika!
Star!

00:46:56.290 --> 00:46:57.820
Magnezone.

00:46:57.820 --> 00:47:02.990
That's the entrance
into the Reverse World.

00:47:02.990 --> 00:47:04.690
Let's go!

00:47:04.690 --> 00:47:06.230
Magnezone!

00:47:07.630 --> 00:47:09.030
Magnemite!

00:47:14.300 --> 00:47:18.040
Piplup!

00:47:18.040 --> 00:47:19.940
Star!

00:47:19.940 --> 00:47:21.880
Staravia!

00:47:25.410 --> 00:47:27.350
This is
the Reverse World?

00:47:27.350 --> 00:47:29.420
(Ash)
We're back
again!

00:47:31.350 --> 00:47:33.050
Oh no!
Pip!

00:47:33.060 --> 00:47:36.290
It's Giratina!
It's huge!

00:47:40.260 --> 00:47:42.200
Giratina,
I'm challenging you!

00:47:42.200 --> 00:47:44.700
You go,
Shaymin!

00:47:44.700 --> 00:47:46.770
Shaymin!

00:47:54.910 --> 00:47:57.110
That's what
I was afraid of!

00:47:57.110 --> 00:48:00.210
Pikachu, Thunderbolt,
let's go! Help Shaymin!

00:48:00.220 --> 00:48:02.920
Pikachu!
Staravia!

00:48:03.950 --> 00:48:05.190
Star!

00:48:05.190 --> 00:48:07.220
Pikachu!

00:48:13.230 --> 00:48:14.960
Pika!

00:48:25.110 --> 00:48:26.970
Shaymin!

00:48:33.180 --> 00:48:35.080
Shaymin!

00:48:36.420 --> 00:48:38.350
Lup!

00:48:38.350 --> 00:48:40.750
Min!

00:48:40.760 --> 00:48:42.360
Min!

00:48:42.360 --> 00:48:45.130
Staravia!

00:48:45.130 --> 00:48:48.130
Pikachu!

00:48:48.130 --> 00:48:49.360
Star!

00:48:49.360 --> 00:48:51.730
Pika!
Staravia!

00:48:51.730 --> 00:48:53.430
Min!

00:48:53.440 --> 00:48:55.300
Min! Min!

00:48:55.300 --> 00:48:56.940
Pika!

00:49:00.340 --> 00:49:02.480
I guess I didn't
want to be eaten!

00:49:04.480 --> 00:49:06.850
But, what happened to
all your strength?

00:49:06.850 --> 00:49:09.180
I'm not so
good at night...

00:49:09.180 --> 00:49:11.950
It could be be that Shaymin
can only take on Sky Form

00:49:11.950 --> 00:49:13.990
during the daytime...

00:49:18.930 --> 00:49:20.990
Why can't you
run any faster?

00:49:21.000 --> 00:49:23.060
Why're you always on me
when we're running'?

00:49:23.070 --> 00:49:25.430
So we'll be eaten
together-- That's why!

00:49:25.430 --> 00:49:27.170
Very funny!

00:49:29.270 --> 00:49:31.510
Quick Pikachu
use Thunderbolt!

00:49:31.510 --> 00:49:34.210
Pikachu!

00:49:37.380 --> 00:49:38.980
Pika!

00:49:41.050 --> 00:49:42.520
(Newton)
Hello!

00:49:42.520 --> 00:49:45.290
Ash,
Dawn up here!

00:49:45.290 --> 00:49:47.050
Wow,
it's Newton!
Pip?

00:49:47.060 --> 00:49:48.260
Newton?

00:49:48.260 --> 00:49:50.020
Pikachu!
Pika!

00:49:50.030 --> 00:49:52.090
Hi, Newton,
I'm Brock!

00:49:52.090 --> 00:49:55.160
Nice to meet you!

00:49:55.160 --> 00:49:57.560
This isn't a place people
usually come back to!

00:49:57.570 --> 00:49:59.900
But, this way!

00:50:02.200 --> 00:50:03.500
Staravia!

00:50:08.480 --> 00:50:11.850
(Ash)
Staravia, return!

00:50:11.850 --> 00:50:14.310
You're all quite a
handful, aren't you?

00:50:14.320 --> 00:50:17.880
Okay, whatever, you're taking
me to the Flower Garden right?

00:50:17.890 --> 00:50:19.420
Giratina's out there.

00:50:19.420 --> 00:50:21.860
We can't just waltz
out of here.

00:50:21.860 --> 00:50:23.990
You'll all abandon
me, I know it!

00:50:23.990 --> 00:50:27.290
Where's all that confidence
you had back in Sky Form...?

00:50:27.300 --> 00:50:29.330
I left it
back in the sky!

00:50:29.330 --> 00:50:32.300
I should have known.
Pikachu!

00:50:41.580 --> 00:50:43.510
Home sweet home.

00:50:43.510 --> 00:50:45.980
I'm finally back...

00:50:45.980 --> 00:50:50.150
Such a beautiful,
quiet and unspoiled world,

00:50:50.150 --> 00:50:53.220
where no one can
bother me...

00:50:53.220 --> 00:50:55.020
At last!

00:50:57.490 --> 00:50:59.160
Welcome,
Master, sir!

00:50:59.160 --> 00:51:00.530
We brought you
some cool stuff!

00:51:00.530 --> 00:51:02.530
Oh!

00:51:02.530 --> 00:51:04.060
How about a
hot towel?

00:51:04.070 --> 00:51:05.500
And something to
wet your whistle?

00:51:05.500 --> 00:51:07.330
Well, thank
you, thank you.

00:51:07.340 --> 00:51:08.870
Team Rocket?

00:51:08.870 --> 00:51:10.900
What're you
doing here?

00:51:10.910 --> 00:51:13.910
Isn't it obvious that
we've become his star pupils?

00:51:13.910 --> 00:51:16.340
His top trio of Reverse
World wonks!

00:51:16.350 --> 00:51:18.910
Actually we just
go and get him junk.

00:51:18.910 --> 00:51:20.110
Hold it,
Newton!

00:51:20.120 --> 00:51:21.510
These guys...

00:51:21.520 --> 00:51:23.880
...are actually quite
helpful to be honest!

00:51:25.420 --> 00:51:28.660
Well, I don't care,
I'm hungry!

00:51:31.660 --> 00:51:33.190
Give me food.

00:51:33.200 --> 00:51:35.160
Gimme a break,
greenback!

00:51:35.160 --> 00:51:37.500
I ain't
got any grub.

00:51:38.970 --> 00:51:41.570
Give me food!

00:51:42.570 --> 00:51:44.170
(Ash)
Shaymin!

00:51:44.170 --> 00:51:45.940
Pika!

00:51:45.940 --> 00:51:47.170
Shieldon!

00:51:53.020 --> 00:51:54.250
Piplup!

00:51:54.250 --> 00:51:56.620
The Shaymin's mine.

00:51:56.620 --> 00:52:00.320
Shaymin!
You again?

00:52:00.320 --> 00:52:02.190
Pika!

00:52:03.190 --> 00:52:04.990
Pikachu!

00:52:04.990 --> 00:52:06.990
Who's
that dude?

00:52:07.000 --> 00:52:09.230
Not sure but I think we
should sit this one out.

00:52:09.230 --> 00:52:12.270
Hide this one
out too...

00:52:15.400 --> 00:52:17.270
No use,
can't move!

00:52:17.270 --> 00:52:19.610
Zero! You!

00:52:19.610 --> 00:52:22.580
Zero was my
assistant once!

00:52:22.580 --> 00:52:25.110
If it isn't the good doctor
Newton Graceland.

00:52:25.110 --> 00:52:26.580
Long time no see.

00:52:26.580 --> 00:52:28.550
You haven't
changed a bit...

00:52:28.550 --> 00:52:31.050
Save it! Why did you come here?

00:52:31.050 --> 00:52:33.320
You know why...

00:52:33.320 --> 00:52:36.460
To make this
wonderful world all mine!

00:52:36.460 --> 00:52:38.690
You're still
on that?

00:52:38.690 --> 00:52:41.160
You have no claim
to this world.

00:52:41.160 --> 00:52:43.530
I never said I did!
Perhaps...

00:52:43.530 --> 00:52:46.300
But you're trying to keep this
beautiful place all to yourself!

00:52:46.300 --> 00:52:48.470
Look!
The Reverse World is vital

00:52:48.470 --> 00:52:51.200
in that it sustains
the real world!

00:52:51.210 --> 00:52:54.140
I've already
figured that out.

00:52:54.140 --> 00:52:56.480
However...

00:53:00.420 --> 00:53:02.380
This place is
beautiful.

00:53:02.380 --> 00:53:04.450
But people
destroy it!

00:53:04.450 --> 00:53:06.250
Defile and
pollute it!

00:53:06.250 --> 00:53:09.290
Wrong! Don't you realize
that's this world's job?

00:53:09.290 --> 00:53:13.190
Magnemite, Magnemite, Magnemite,
Magnemite, Magnemite...

00:53:13.200 --> 00:53:15.100
Ah, yes
that's right...

00:53:15.100 --> 00:53:17.360
I've forgotten to mention
that I've finished building

00:53:17.370 --> 00:53:19.100
your invention
for you!

00:53:19.100 --> 00:53:20.730
Oh, no!

00:53:20.740 --> 00:53:22.770
Don't breathe in!

00:53:22.770 --> 00:53:25.340
Piplup!

00:53:25.340 --> 00:53:26.740
Min!

00:53:26.740 --> 00:53:28.680
Magnemite,
Magnemite!

00:53:31.010 --> 00:53:32.680
Shaymin!

00:53:32.680 --> 00:53:34.350
Dawn!

00:53:34.350 --> 00:53:37.050
Min!

00:53:37.050 --> 00:53:39.620
Shaymin!

00:53:39.620 --> 00:53:41.760
Min!

00:53:42.790 --> 00:53:44.320
There we go.

00:53:44.330 --> 00:53:47.760
Min...

00:53:47.760 --> 00:53:49.800
What a pity,
Giratina...

00:53:49.800 --> 00:53:53.230
Because of Dialga, you
lost your ability to travel

00:53:53.240 --> 00:53:55.370
back to the real world,

00:53:55.370 --> 00:53:57.570
but I'll
help you...

00:54:00.480 --> 00:54:02.140
Pika!

00:54:02.140 --> 00:54:04.640
Min...

00:54:04.650 --> 00:54:06.150
Of course!

00:54:06.150 --> 00:54:08.520
That's
Seed Flare!

00:54:16.430 --> 00:54:19.690
Giratina's here!

00:54:19.690 --> 00:54:23.530
Now, open a hole
using Seed Flare!

00:54:23.530 --> 00:54:25.630
Help Giratina...

00:54:25.630 --> 00:54:27.800
Allow it
to leave now!

00:54:27.800 --> 00:54:30.840
Hole?

00:54:30.840 --> 00:54:33.740
Magneton!
Magnemite, Magnemite!

00:54:33.740 --> 00:54:35.780
Magnemite!
Magneton, Magneton!

00:54:35.780 --> 00:54:38.110
It's getting
rid of the Magnemite!

00:54:38.110 --> 00:54:41.350
Giratina has no interest
in eating Shaymin!

00:54:45.650 --> 00:54:47.620
Min!

00:54:51.290 --> 00:54:53.790
It's going
to eat me!

00:54:55.630 --> 00:54:58.530
Shaymin doesn't
understand!

00:55:01.170 --> 00:55:03.140
Here we go!

00:55:05.510 --> 00:55:07.370
Pika!

00:55:21.520 --> 00:55:23.320
Min!

00:55:25.530 --> 00:55:27.830
Pika, Pi!

00:55:27.830 --> 00:55:30.260
Pika!

00:55:30.270 --> 00:55:32.300
And now, Giratina...

00:55:32.300 --> 00:55:35.300
Realize your dream and
go to the real world!

00:55:43.610 --> 00:55:45.610
Pika...

00:55:51.390 --> 00:55:53.390
It's a glacier!

00:55:53.390 --> 00:55:54.750
(Dawn)
Shaymin!

00:55:57.930 --> 00:56:00.560
Shaymin, you
all right?

00:56:00.560 --> 00:56:02.730
It was about
to eat me!

00:56:02.730 --> 00:56:03.930
You're wrong.

00:56:03.930 --> 00:56:06.670
Giratina wasn't
trying to eat you...

00:56:12.910 --> 00:56:15.780
Giratina only wanted to get
you to use Seed Flare

00:56:15.780 --> 00:56:18.340
so it could come
forth into this world.

00:56:18.350 --> 00:56:22.180
It was also trying to get rid
of all the Magnemite!

00:56:23.650 --> 00:56:25.290
Piplup!

00:56:34.830 --> 00:56:36.530
It looks different!

00:56:36.530 --> 00:56:39.470
It probably has to do with
the gravity change...

00:56:39.470 --> 00:56:41.330
Pika!

00:56:44.770 --> 00:56:47.940
¶

00:56:55.650 --> 00:56:57.680
Pika!

00:56:57.690 --> 00:57:00.420
What's that?
Piplup!

00:57:27.350 --> 00:57:28.850
Magnezone!

00:57:30.550 --> 00:57:33.690
Giratina, I have been
waiting such a long time now

00:57:33.690 --> 00:57:35.760
for you to come here!

00:57:38.690 --> 00:57:41.290
Pika?

00:57:41.300 --> 00:57:43.260
What is Zero
up to?

00:58:02.450 --> 00:58:04.620
(Infi)
<i> Giratina is returning</i>
<i> to its condition</i>

00:58:04.620 --> 00:58:06.420
<i> before making</i>
<i> contact with Dialga.</i>

00:58:06.420 --> 00:58:08.390
<i> It is already capable of</i>
<i> entering and leaving</i>

00:58:08.390 --> 00:58:10.290
<i> the Reverse World.</i>

00:58:10.290 --> 00:58:12.860
Giratina's Reverse World arrival
has shattered the time loop.

00:58:12.860 --> 00:58:16.360
Infi, now,
commence scanning process!

00:58:16.360 --> 00:58:17.800
<i> Understood.</i>

00:58:17.800 --> 00:58:20.070
<i> Beginning scan</i>
<i> immediately.</i>

00:58:36.890 --> 00:58:38.080
It's true...

00:58:38.090 --> 00:58:40.650
I designed that
machine.

00:58:40.660 --> 00:58:42.790
I built it so I'd
be able to absorb

00:58:42.790 --> 00:58:44.590
all of Giratina's
abilities!

00:58:44.590 --> 00:58:46.760
But why
would you do that?

00:58:49.100 --> 00:58:52.970
So I could enter and leave the
Reverse World at will!

00:58:52.970 --> 00:58:56.370
At that point...

00:58:56.370 --> 00:58:59.640
I realized Giratina
would then be sacrificed!

00:59:01.540 --> 00:59:03.110
This project is
terminated!

00:59:03.110 --> 00:59:05.010
Master... What are you saying?

00:59:05.010 --> 00:59:07.980
We can't use Giratina
as a sacrifice

00:59:07.980 --> 00:59:10.550
just for the
sake of our research!

00:59:19.530 --> 00:59:21.630
What are
you doing?

00:59:28.770 --> 00:59:30.640
My blueprints...

00:59:30.640 --> 00:59:33.470
I'm deleting
all of them!

00:59:35.710 --> 00:59:36.940
(Newton)
But...

00:59:36.950 --> 00:59:39.910
Obviously Zero
never forgot them!

00:59:39.910 --> 00:59:43.480
And if that thing was built
to my specifications,

00:59:43.490 --> 00:59:46.650
Giratina will
soon be no more.

00:59:46.650 --> 00:59:48.650
You mean Giratina's
gonna...
Pika!

00:59:51.630 --> 00:59:55.700
It won't be long before
the Reverse World is all mine!

00:59:55.700 --> 00:59:58.660
And then I will rule
there like a king!

01:00:04.670 --> 01:00:06.110
Shieldon,
Shieldon, Shieldon!

01:00:06.110 --> 01:00:08.640
Shieldon, Shieldon!

01:00:08.640 --> 01:00:10.010
Shield!

01:00:10.010 --> 01:00:11.640
Where're you
going?

01:00:11.650 --> 01:00:13.710
This whole thing
is my fault.

01:00:13.720 --> 01:00:15.880
I have to make
sure Giratina's safe!

01:00:15.880 --> 01:00:17.150
I'm comin' too!

01:00:17.150 --> 01:00:18.950
Piplup!
Me too!

01:00:18.950 --> 01:00:21.120
Shaymin,
you wait here.

01:00:22.660 --> 01:00:24.990
Piplup!

01:00:32.430 --> 01:00:34.070
Finally!

01:00:34.070 --> 01:00:37.600
This is
the Gracidea Flower Garden!

01:00:45.680 --> 01:00:47.850
Well, I'm going
on ahead!

01:00:47.850 --> 01:00:49.850
Shaymin!
Let's go!

01:00:49.850 --> 01:00:51.820
Right!

01:00:51.820 --> 01:00:53.620
Hey!

01:00:53.620 --> 01:00:56.160
I'm starting to
sense a pattern...

01:01:05.770 --> 01:01:06.970
He can't...

01:01:06.970 --> 01:01:09.640
He won't!
Pika!

01:01:09.640 --> 01:01:12.140
We will
all help Giratina!

01:01:12.140 --> 01:01:14.040
Take care of
them.

01:01:18.050 --> 01:01:20.150
Magnemite!
Magnezone!

01:01:24.890 --> 01:01:26.120
Zone!

01:01:27.120 --> 01:01:29.090
Zone!

01:01:29.090 --> 01:01:31.060
Shaymin!

01:01:31.060 --> 01:01:32.830
Magnezone!

01:01:34.700 --> 01:01:36.160
Magnemite!

01:01:43.270 --> 01:01:45.640
Prepare to enter
the Reverse World.

01:01:45.640 --> 01:01:47.910
(Infi)
<i> As you wish.</i>

01:02:00.860 --> 01:02:02.620
Pikachu,
Thunderbolt, now!

01:02:02.620 --> 01:02:04.020
Bubblebeam Piplup
let's go!

01:02:04.030 --> 01:02:06.260
Piplup, Lup, Lup!
Chu!

01:02:09.030 --> 01:02:10.730
It didn't do
a thing!

01:02:10.730 --> 01:02:12.230
They bounced
right off!

01:02:12.230 --> 01:02:15.270
Then I'll have to go
in and stop him myself!

01:02:22.010 --> 01:02:24.610
Magnezone!

01:02:29.050 --> 01:02:30.880
Zone!

01:02:34.290 --> 01:02:36.060
Shaymin!

01:02:45.830 --> 01:02:48.770
Lup, Lup, Lup!
Chu!

01:02:57.580 --> 01:02:59.110
Shield!

01:02:59.110 --> 01:03:01.810
Newton!
I should be able
to get in through here!

01:03:01.820 --> 01:03:03.920
Pikachu!
Piplup!

01:03:03.920 --> 01:03:05.250
Chu!

01:03:05.250 --> 01:03:06.920
We'll take care
of the Magnemite!

01:03:06.920 --> 01:03:08.250
(Shaymin)
I'll help too!

01:03:08.260 --> 01:03:09.820
Chu.
Great, thanks!

01:03:09.820 --> 01:03:12.290
Shieldon,
Flash Cannon!

01:03:12.290 --> 01:03:14.630
Shieldon!

01:03:19.100 --> 01:03:20.830
Yes!

01:03:24.770 --> 01:03:27.810
(Infi)
<i> Scanning is</i>
<i> now 50% complete.</i>

01:03:29.910 --> 01:03:34.310
Chu!

01:03:34.320 --> 01:03:35.780
Chu!

01:03:36.820 --> 01:03:38.350
Bui!

01:03:38.350 --> 01:03:40.250
Ambipom!

01:03:40.250 --> 01:03:42.320
Piplup, Lup, Lup!
There Buneary Icebeam!

01:03:42.320 --> 01:03:43.860
Buneary!

01:03:45.190 --> 01:03:48.260
Shaymin!
Magnemite!

01:03:53.200 --> 01:03:54.400
Zero!

01:03:54.400 --> 01:03:56.070
Stop this at once!

01:03:56.070 --> 01:03:57.800
Shieldon,
Shieldon!

01:03:59.210 --> 01:04:01.740
<i> You're too late...</i>

01:04:01.740 --> 01:04:04.210
<i> I invite you to sit and watch</i>
<i> as the execution</i>

01:04:04.210 --> 01:04:07.050
<i> of my beautiful</i>
<i> plan is made real!</i>

01:04:12.790 --> 01:04:14.250
Chu!

01:04:29.370 --> 01:04:30.940
Come on, Newton...

01:04:30.940 --> 01:04:32.870
Hurry up!

01:04:38.280 --> 01:04:40.150
I guess he forgot...

01:04:40.150 --> 01:04:42.820
This thing
is my design!

01:04:46.250 --> 01:04:50.090
(alarm beeping)

01:04:50.090 --> 01:04:52.090
(Infi)
<i>The system has just</i>
<i> been hacked.</i>

01:04:52.090 --> 01:04:54.730
But what
about the scan?

01:04:54.730 --> 01:04:57.960
<i>Over 91% complete.</i>

01:04:59.270 --> 01:05:02.270
¶

01:05:08.480 --> 01:05:09.880
All right!

01:05:09.880 --> 01:05:11.410
How do you
like this?

01:05:57.130 --> 01:05:58.520
It stopped!
Pip, Piplup!

01:05:58.530 --> 01:06:00.230
Newton,
great job!

01:06:00.230 --> 01:06:02.090
Pikachu!

01:06:07.140 --> 01:06:08.870
Pika!
Hey, Newton!

01:06:08.870 --> 01:06:10.870
I'm sorry.

01:06:10.870 --> 01:06:14.140
To shut down the systems I had
to shut down the engines, too.

01:06:14.140 --> 01:06:15.470
So what
does that mean?

01:06:15.480 --> 01:06:18.040
It means that
this thing's going down!

01:06:23.020 --> 01:06:24.520
(Ash)
Everybody return!

01:06:26.950 --> 01:06:29.520
(Dawn)
Return!

01:06:36.260 --> 01:06:37.500
Oh, no...

01:06:37.500 --> 01:06:38.960
Ash, Dawn!

01:07:21.140 --> 01:07:24.510
¶

01:07:51.340 --> 01:07:53.010
Pidgey!

01:07:53.010 --> 01:07:54.910
Pidgey, Pidgey!
Pidgey!

01:07:54.910 --> 01:07:57.340
Pidgey!

01:08:06.650 --> 01:08:09.660
¶

01:08:30.440 --> 01:08:32.540
Hey, guys--
You all right?

01:08:32.550 --> 01:08:34.210
Giratina!

01:08:34.220 --> 01:08:37.280
Pikachu!

01:08:37.290 --> 01:08:38.650
Pika, Pika!

01:08:38.650 --> 01:08:42.120
Piplup, Pip,
Piplup, Pip!

01:08:42.120 --> 01:08:43.590
Pika, Pika!

01:08:45.090 --> 01:08:47.230
We're too late...!

01:08:48.960 --> 01:08:50.230
Sentret,
Sentret, Sentret?

01:08:50.230 --> 01:08:52.330
Furr, Furret?

01:08:52.330 --> 01:08:53.930
Stant...

01:08:56.470 --> 01:08:59.310
It's breathing!

01:08:59.310 --> 01:09:01.370
Giratina,
come on!

01:09:01.380 --> 01:09:04.510
Pika, Pika!
You must pull through!

01:09:13.420 --> 01:09:16.390
Shay...

01:09:18.960 --> 01:09:22.290
Giratina,
stay with me!

01:09:22.300 --> 01:09:27.230
Shay, Shay...

01:09:27.230 --> 01:09:28.530
Pika!

01:09:28.540 --> 01:09:30.240
Aromatherapy!

01:09:30.240 --> 01:09:32.300
That's one of
Shaymin's moves!

01:09:32.310 --> 01:09:37.280
Shay...

01:09:37.280 --> 01:09:40.080
Shay!

01:09:43.220 --> 01:09:47.550
¶

01:09:55.060 --> 01:09:57.030
Lup?
Pika?

01:10:05.710 --> 01:10:09.380
¶

01:10:23.620 --> 01:10:25.220
Giratina!

01:10:25.230 --> 01:10:27.590
It's Shaymin who
made you feel better!

01:10:31.370 --> 01:10:32.700
Pika, Pika!

01:10:32.700 --> 01:10:34.730
Pikachu!

01:10:36.700 --> 01:10:38.100
Pika, Pika!

01:10:38.110 --> 01:10:40.310
Pikachu!

01:10:40.310 --> 01:10:41.510
Pikachu.

01:10:41.510 --> 01:10:43.180
Wait for me!

01:10:44.480 --> 01:10:47.310
Thank goodness
you're all right!

01:10:47.310 --> 01:10:49.110
Sentret!

01:10:49.120 --> 01:10:51.520
Bidoof!

01:10:53.250 --> 01:10:56.820
Guess they were all worried
about Giratina, huh...?

01:10:56.820 --> 01:10:59.060
They would know
what was at stake,

01:10:59.060 --> 01:11:02.830
and just how important
the Reverse World is!

01:11:04.200 --> 01:11:05.830
Pi!

01:11:05.830 --> 01:11:07.530
Pika!

01:11:14.810 --> 01:11:16.310
Is that...?

01:11:16.310 --> 01:11:18.740
Zero!

01:11:20.610 --> 01:11:23.380
¶

01:11:30.590 --> 01:11:33.560
I couldn't care less
what they think they've done.

01:11:33.560 --> 01:11:35.760
No one gets in
my way!

01:11:39.400 --> 01:11:41.170
Pi, Pi!

01:11:44.710 --> 01:11:46.810
Quick, Pikachu
use Thunderbolt!

01:11:46.810 --> 01:11:48.640
Piplup You
use Bubblebeam!

01:11:48.640 --> 01:11:51.210
Piplup, Lup,
Lup, Lup!
Now Shieldon, Flash Cannon, go!

01:11:51.210 --> 01:11:53.250
Shieldon!

01:11:53.250 --> 01:11:55.380
I said stay
out of my way!

01:12:04.330 --> 01:12:05.590
He's gone!
Pika!

01:12:05.590 --> 01:12:07.630
He went to the Reverse World!
Shield!

01:12:07.630 --> 01:12:11.260
Zero's managed to acquire
all of Giratina's powers!

01:12:16.670 --> 01:12:18.540
What is that?

01:12:18.540 --> 01:12:21.340
Not sure, but it's no doubt
sporting someone on the inside!

01:12:21.340 --> 01:12:25.440
We don't care if you're nastier
than we are, save us!

01:12:31.450 --> 01:12:34.290
Look at you all in
your pathetic, filthy world!

01:12:34.290 --> 01:12:36.690
Disappear, all of you!

01:12:43.630 --> 01:12:45.430
What was that?

01:12:45.430 --> 01:12:48.930
Zero's attacking the real world
from the Reverse World!

01:12:59.210 --> 01:13:02.810
I'm going, too!
Pikachu!

01:13:02.820 --> 01:13:04.220
But, Ash!

01:13:04.220 --> 01:13:05.720
Wait for me!

01:13:14.360 --> 01:13:16.260
My lovely
Reverse World...

01:13:16.260 --> 01:13:20.930
They won't tarnish its
beauty again!

01:13:20.940 --> 01:13:24.700
The Reverse World's true power
will forever shine through!

01:13:34.550 --> 01:13:39.320
(ethereal rending)

01:13:59.510 --> 01:14:03.580
Regigigas...

01:14:22.860 --> 01:14:25.430
Shield...
Piplup!

01:14:25.430 --> 01:14:27.800
¶

01:14:34.610 --> 01:14:36.940
Piplup!
The glacier!

01:14:36.940 --> 01:14:39.440
It's moving!
Zero's doing this!

01:14:39.450 --> 01:14:41.350
But how?

01:14:43.550 --> 01:14:46.350
(Infi)
<i> The Glacier has lost its</i>
<i> support in the Reverse World</i>

01:14:46.350 --> 01:14:48.590
<i> and has begun moving.</i>
Excellent!

01:14:48.590 --> 01:14:50.020
Just as
I planned!

01:14:50.020 --> 01:14:52.320
Continue to collect data!

01:14:52.330 --> 01:14:54.730
<i> As you wish, sir.</i>

01:14:54.730 --> 01:14:56.500
Perfect!

01:14:59.500 --> 01:15:02.870
(Newton)
The Real and Reverse Worlds
support each other!

01:15:02.870 --> 01:15:04.400
Zero...

01:15:04.410 --> 01:15:07.310
Do you really
want to destroy that?

01:15:21.620 --> 01:15:24.460
Chu!
Min!

01:15:27.360 --> 01:15:29.060
Zero,
give it up now!

01:15:29.060 --> 01:15:30.660
Stop this!

01:15:30.660 --> 01:15:32.930
Why?
You just don't understand...

01:15:32.930 --> 01:15:35.700
I'm protecting this
place!

01:15:47.410 --> 01:15:49.010
(Dawn)
Swinub,
Ice Shard!

01:15:49.020 --> 01:15:50.580
Buneary, Ice Beam!

01:15:50.580 --> 01:15:53.050
Nub!
Buneary!

01:15:54.790 --> 01:15:56.860
Bidoof!
Bibarel!

01:15:58.090 --> 01:16:00.830
Froslass!
Abomasnow!
Snover!

01:16:10.540 --> 01:16:13.140
¶

01:16:25.650 --> 01:16:28.390
All of your
powers now belong to me!

01:16:42.140 --> 01:16:44.000
Chimchar,
use Flamethrower!

01:16:44.000 --> 01:16:45.670
Turtwig, Energy Ball!

01:16:45.670 --> 01:16:47.610
Now, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!
Chimchar!

01:16:47.610 --> 01:16:49.010
Twig!
Chu!

01:17:02.490 --> 01:17:04.560
Char!

01:17:13.570 --> 01:17:15.430
No use,
it's not stopping!

01:17:15.440 --> 01:17:18.600
If this keeps up it's going
to crush the Flower Garden!

01:17:18.610 --> 01:17:20.140
That's not all
that'll be crushed.

01:17:20.140 --> 01:17:24.110
All the villages and towns
just ahead...

01:17:24.110 --> 01:17:28.610
¶

01:17:35.060 --> 01:17:37.220
They're all
doomed to be destroyed!

01:17:37.220 --> 01:17:39.020
Oh, no!
How could he?

01:17:42.000 --> 01:17:43.860
Piplup, Piplup,
Piplup!

01:17:43.860 --> 01:17:46.200
Buneary!
Swinub!

01:18:01.880 --> 01:18:03.080
Is that a...?

01:18:03.080 --> 01:18:04.880
Regigigas!

01:18:04.890 --> 01:18:06.750
Regigigas!

01:18:06.750 --> 01:18:08.520
Mamo!
Mamoswine!

01:18:08.520 --> 01:18:10.820
Mamo!

01:18:11.860 --> 01:18:14.030
Mamoswine!

01:18:14.030 --> 01:18:15.930
There're some
more!

01:18:15.930 --> 01:18:18.630
Mamo!
Mamo, Mamoswine!

01:18:19.930 --> 01:18:21.800
Mamo!

01:18:36.050 --> 01:18:39.620
The Reverse World
belongs to me!

01:18:47.260 --> 01:18:49.630
Pika!
No, Giratina!

01:18:52.970 --> 01:18:55.570
Mamo!
Mamo!

01:18:55.570 --> 01:18:57.240
Mamo!

01:19:00.240 --> 01:19:02.040
Mamo!

01:19:07.180 --> 01:19:09.210
Look at Regigigas
and the Mamoswine!

01:19:09.220 --> 01:19:12.850
They're all trying to
stop the glacier!
Piplup!

01:19:23.760 --> 01:19:26.800
¶

01:19:42.220 --> 01:19:45.150
I'll bet him helping us
is not going to happen...

01:19:45.150 --> 01:19:46.350
Safe bet.

01:19:46.350 --> 01:19:48.290
I've got
four-to-one odds.

01:19:48.290 --> 01:19:50.260
(Team Rocket)
Losers take all!

01:19:52.760 --> 01:19:55.730
Giratina, this will
be over very soon!

01:19:57.000 --> 01:19:59.360
Chu!

01:19:59.370 --> 01:20:00.830
Pikachu,
use Thunderbolt,

01:20:00.830 --> 01:20:02.930
and Chimchar, use
Flamethrower!

01:20:02.940 --> 01:20:04.970
Pikachu!
Chimchar!

01:20:08.210 --> 01:20:10.010
Out of my way!

01:20:13.610 --> 01:20:15.710
Pika!

01:20:15.720 --> 01:20:17.220
Pi!

01:20:19.090 --> 01:20:21.090
All right,
are you okay?

01:20:21.090 --> 01:20:23.020
Pikachu!
Chimchar!

01:20:29.700 --> 01:20:32.360
Pi, Pi, Pi, Pi...

01:20:32.370 --> 01:20:34.930
Pikachu!

01:20:34.940 --> 01:20:36.230
Shaymin!

01:20:36.240 --> 01:20:38.070
A simple "thank you"
will suffice!

01:20:38.070 --> 01:20:39.300
Pika!

01:20:39.310 --> 01:20:41.310
Twig...
Char...

01:20:41.310 --> 01:20:43.980
Turtwig, Chimchar!

01:20:43.980 --> 01:20:45.410
Return!

01:20:56.660 --> 01:20:58.420
Hey-- You stop
destroying this place, Zero!

01:20:58.430 --> 01:21:00.330
Pika!

01:21:00.330 --> 01:21:03.800
If anything is destroying this
place, it's the real world!

01:21:10.700 --> 01:21:12.440
Pika!

01:21:16.910 --> 01:21:18.840
There--
Look at that toxic cloud!

01:21:18.850 --> 01:21:21.810
Don't you see this
glorious world

01:21:21.820 --> 01:21:23.780
is constantly
being polluted?

01:21:23.780 --> 01:21:28.090
So don't you understand,
I'm protecting it!

01:21:28.090 --> 01:21:30.960
No! The real and reverse worlds
support each other!

01:21:30.960 --> 01:21:33.120
Pika!

01:21:33.130 --> 01:21:35.160
Ash-- I'll take
care of this!

01:21:35.160 --> 01:21:36.360
Shaymin!

01:21:36.360 --> 01:21:38.300
Min...

01:21:41.970 --> 01:21:45.740
Regigigas...

01:21:50.080 --> 01:21:51.840
Can they
really hold it back?

01:21:51.850 --> 01:21:54.210
You can do it,
Regigigas!

01:21:54.210 --> 01:21:56.010
Piplup!

01:22:03.820 --> 01:22:06.390
We've gotta do
something!

01:22:06.390 --> 01:22:08.990
Min!

01:22:09.000 --> 01:22:11.400
'Kay Shaymin,
use Seed Flare now!

01:22:11.400 --> 01:22:13.200
We've gotta knock Zero
out of here!

01:22:13.200 --> 01:22:16.270
I don't think so!

01:22:16.270 --> 01:22:18.500
All right, Pikachu,
Thunderbolt!

01:22:18.510 --> 01:22:20.140
Chu!

01:22:20.140 --> 01:22:21.340
Oh, really?

01:22:21.340 --> 01:22:23.440
Your turn to be
knocked!

01:22:24.880 --> 01:22:26.340
What the...?

01:22:26.350 --> 01:22:27.810
Pika!

01:22:33.520 --> 01:22:36.090
I warned you to
stay out of my way!

01:22:42.500 --> 01:22:44.800
No, Giratina...!
Pika!

01:22:44.800 --> 01:22:46.000
Shaymin,
it's up to you!

01:22:46.000 --> 01:22:47.870
I'm ready!

01:22:50.070 --> 01:22:52.900
Min...

01:22:58.280 --> 01:23:00.310
I have had
enough of you!

01:23:04.850 --> 01:23:07.420
Now, Shaymin! Go!

01:23:07.420 --> 01:23:09.790
Min!

01:23:23.900 --> 01:23:25.200
Pika!

01:23:25.210 --> 01:23:27.810
What's that?

01:23:29.510 --> 01:23:31.410
Shaymin opened
up a portal!

01:23:31.410 --> 01:23:33.080
Shaymin did?

01:23:40.490 --> 01:23:42.520
Pika!

01:23:49.330 --> 01:23:51.100
(Infi)
<i> Systems down.</i>

01:23:51.100 --> 01:23:52.600
<i> Systems down.</i>

01:23:54.970 --> 01:23:56.200
Mamo!

01:23:58.340 --> 01:24:01.170
Quick Buneary,
use Ice Beam!

01:24:01.170 --> 01:24:02.610
Swinub, Ice Shard!

01:24:02.610 --> 01:24:05.080
Swinub!
Mamoswine!

01:24:12.350 --> 01:24:14.290
(Infi)
<i> All systems</i>
<i> have been shut down.</i>

01:24:14.290 --> 01:24:16.990
(Zero)
Recover data on Giratina.

01:24:16.990 --> 01:24:20.090
<i> All systems down.</i>
<i> Unable to recover.</i>

01:24:20.090 --> 01:24:21.290
Oh, no!

01:24:21.290 --> 01:24:29.130
<i> All systems down.</i>

01:24:29.140 --> 01:24:34.510
Every single one of my glorious
plans...they're ruined.

01:24:34.510 --> 01:24:38.210
<i> All systems down...</i>

01:24:42.080 --> 01:24:45.180
(Team Rocket)
Lousy weather
for flying!

01:24:48.560 --> 01:24:52.120
I am really not
that good with the cold!

01:25:00.200 --> 01:25:01.630
Shaymin,
are you okay?

01:25:01.640 --> 01:25:04.340
I am the teensiest
bit scared.

01:25:04.340 --> 01:25:05.670
Where's Ash
and Pikachu?

01:25:05.670 --> 01:25:07.370
They must still
be there!

01:25:07.370 --> 01:25:08.570
Bunear?

01:25:08.580 --> 01:25:10.280
Plup?

01:25:40.570 --> 01:25:45.940
¶

01:26:04.100 --> 01:26:06.430
Gigas...

01:26:08.270 --> 01:26:10.000
Gigas.

01:26:10.000 --> 01:26:12.300
Mamo!
Mamo!

01:26:15.680 --> 01:26:18.340
It stopped!
Piplup.

01:26:22.720 --> 01:26:24.480
What's that?

01:26:33.430 --> 01:26:35.290
¶

01:26:35.300 --> 01:26:38.530
Swine, Swine!
Hello down there!

01:26:38.530 --> 01:26:40.700
Pikachu!

01:26:46.240 --> 01:26:48.270
Dawn! Hey, Brock!

01:26:48.270 --> 01:26:49.610
Pika!

01:26:49.610 --> 01:26:51.510
It's Ash!
Bunear, Bunear!

01:26:51.510 --> 01:26:54.110
Piplup, Piplup!

01:27:03.190 --> 01:27:04.620
Yeah!

01:27:04.620 --> 01:27:06.720
Ash!
Piplup, Piplup!

01:27:06.730 --> 01:27:09.460
Pikachu!
I'm glad you're safe!

01:27:09.460 --> 01:27:13.030
Thanks--
Giratina saved us.

01:27:19.510 --> 01:27:22.310
Where is Giratina going?

01:27:27.080 --> 01:27:30.380
¶

01:27:32.420 --> 01:27:35.520
I'm wondering
if Dialga's near.

01:28:02.080 --> 01:28:03.280
Pika.

01:28:03.280 --> 01:28:06.120
Piplup.

01:28:06.120 --> 01:28:09.720
Pika?
Pip, Pip?

01:28:11.830 --> 01:28:13.220
Min?

01:28:13.230 --> 01:28:14.430
Min!

01:28:14.430 --> 01:28:15.660
Min?
Piplup!

01:28:15.660 --> 01:28:17.260
Pika!

01:28:17.260 --> 01:28:19.160
Min!
Min!

01:28:19.170 --> 01:28:21.330
Min, Min!

01:28:21.330 --> 01:28:23.130
Shaymin, are
they your friends?

01:28:23.140 --> 01:28:24.400
Sure are!

01:28:24.400 --> 01:28:26.200
It's a good thing
we weren't late.

01:28:26.210 --> 01:28:28.570
True,
thanks to you all!

01:28:28.580 --> 01:28:31.140
Pika!
Lup!

01:28:37.650 --> 01:28:41.820
¶

01:28:44.160 --> 01:28:46.560
Quick, look!

01:28:46.560 --> 01:28:48.590
It's the Gracidea
Flowers!

01:29:08.520 --> 01:29:11.220
Beautiful!
Pika!

01:29:11.220 --> 01:29:12.520
Shaymin...

01:29:12.520 --> 01:29:14.750
It's great to be
able to see this place!

01:29:14.750 --> 01:29:17.160
Does that mean you are
grateful to Shaymin?

01:29:17.160 --> 01:29:18.890
Yeah, you
bet I'm grateful!

01:29:23.430 --> 01:29:27.500
Ash I must say
I am grateful to you too!

01:29:28.800 --> 01:29:30.870
Thanks, Shaymin.

01:29:33.940 --> 01:29:36.310
Min!

01:29:36.310 --> 01:29:38.210
Min!
Min!

01:29:39.350 --> 01:29:41.650
Min!
Min!

01:29:46.420 --> 01:29:49.690
Dawn, Ash, Brock...

01:29:49.690 --> 01:29:51.560
All of you...

01:29:51.560 --> 01:29:56.390
I'll never be able to
thank you enough, but I'll try!

01:29:56.400 --> 01:29:57.800
Thank you!

01:29:57.800 --> 01:30:00.330
Shaymin!

01:30:03.200 --> 01:30:05.440
Here is
where I say goodbye.

01:30:05.440 --> 01:30:06.870
Yeah, we know.

01:30:06.870 --> 01:30:08.670
Pika!

01:30:10.240 --> 01:30:12.810
¶

01:30:40.870 --> 01:30:42.640
Lup!

01:30:42.640 --> 01:30:44.340
Pika!

01:30:49.250 --> 01:30:52.720
It's the Sky Bouquet!

01:31:03.700 --> 01:31:06.700
(Shaymin)
Farewell,
my good friends!

01:31:15.940 --> 01:31:17.510
Shaymin!

01:31:17.510 --> 01:31:18.810
Pika!

01:31:18.810 --> 01:31:21.910
Bye, Shaymin...
Piplup!

01:31:24.880 --> 01:31:27.820
Make a pretty
garden, everybody!

01:31:27.820 --> 01:31:31.960
And someday, I hope...
I see you again!

01:31:31.960 --> 01:31:34.330
Oh, Ash...

01:31:36.860 --> 01:31:40.870
And make sure you
guys don't get lost!

01:32:07.090 --> 01:32:11.500
¶

01:32:24.580 --> 01:32:28.850
¶ Every day we just keep going
through the motions ¶

01:32:28.850 --> 01:32:31.650
¶ And we don't know why ¶

01:32:34.720 --> 01:32:38.720
¶ Seems like we never
stop to take the time ¶

01:32:38.730 --> 01:32:42.460
¶ To notice life as
it goes by ¶

01:32:44.960 --> 01:32:47.600
¶ But there's a
whole world out there ¶

01:32:47.600 --> 01:32:50.400
¶ It's a miracle to see ¶

01:32:50.400 --> 01:32:53.540
¶ Like the colors of
a rainbow ¶

01:32:53.540 --> 01:32:55.740
¶ It's a living symphony ¶

01:32:55.740 --> 01:32:58.140
¶ So open your eyes ¶

01:32:58.140 --> 01:33:01.110
¶ It's easy to do ¶

01:33:01.110 --> 01:33:07.050
¶ Just take the time
and look around you ¶

01:33:07.050 --> 01:33:09.450
¶ Never forget ¶

01:33:09.460 --> 01:33:13.860
¶ This is a beautiful world ¶

01:33:17.130 --> 01:33:20.830
¶ Do we really
celebrate the beauty ¶

01:33:20.830 --> 01:33:24.600
¶ That surrounds us every
single day ¶

01:33:28.170 --> 01:33:33.010
¶ Or ever realize the
gifts that we've been given ¶

01:33:33.010 --> 01:33:36.080
¶ Might just go away ¶

01:33:38.720 --> 01:33:41.090
¶ We can't let it happen ¶

01:33:41.090 --> 01:33:43.820
¶ It's up to you and me ¶

01:33:43.820 --> 01:33:45.820
¶ We've got
to work together ¶

01:33:45.830 --> 01:33:49.090
¶ It's our responsibility ¶

01:33:49.100 --> 01:33:51.600
¶ So open your eyes ¶

01:33:51.600 --> 01:33:54.730
¶ It's easy to do ¶

01:33:54.730 --> 01:34:00.570
¶ Just take the time
and look around you ¶

01:34:00.570 --> 01:34:03.110
¶ Never forget ¶

01:34:03.110 --> 01:34:06.710
¶ This is
a beautiful world ¶

01:34:06.710 --> 01:34:09.110
¶ It's a beautiful world ¶

01:34:32.040 --> 01:34:34.640
¶ There's a whole world
out there ¶

01:34:34.640 --> 01:34:37.140
¶ Be thankful every day ¶

01:34:37.140 --> 01:34:42.180
¶ And grateful
for the magic ¶

01:34:42.180 --> 01:34:45.180
¶ That touches us
so many ways ¶

01:34:47.690 --> 01:34:50.150
¶ So open your eyes ¶

01:34:50.160 --> 01:34:53.160
¶ It's easy to do ¶

01:34:53.160 --> 01:34:58.730
¶ Just take the time
and look around you ¶

01:34:58.730 --> 01:35:01.500
¶ Never forget ¶

01:35:01.500 --> 01:35:06.270
¶ This is
a beautiful world ¶

01:35:06.270 --> 01:35:08.910
¶ Oh yeah ¶

01:35:08.910 --> 01:35:11.680
¶ So open your eyes ¶

01:35:11.680 --> 01:35:14.750
¶ It's easy to do ¶

01:35:14.750 --> 01:35:20.050
¶ Just take the time
and look around you ¶

01:35:20.050 --> 01:35:22.820
¶ Never forget ¶

01:35:22.820 --> 01:35:27.190
¶ This is
a beautiful world ¶

01:35:33.030 --> 01:35:35.230
¶ Just take the time ¶

01:35:38.300 --> 01:35:41.240
¶ And open your eyes ¶

01:35:41.240 --> 01:35:43.910
¶ Never forget ¶

01:35:43.910 --> 01:35:48.010
¶ This is a beautiful world ¶

01:35:50.320 --> 01:35:52.680
¶ This beautiful world ¶

01:35:59.330 --> 01:36:01.890
¶ Just open your eyes ¶

01:36:05.130 --> 01:36:09.730
¶ This is a beautiful world ¶

01:36:11.700 --> 01:36:13.940
¶ It's a beautiful world ¶
